          "type" : "block",
          "children" : [ {
            "attributes" : {
              "align" : "left",
              "lightning:borderRadius" : "{!$brand.borderRadius.square}",
              "lightning:borderWidth" : "{!$brand.borderWeight.none}",
              "lightning:colorGroup" : {
                "backgroundColor" : "{!$brand.colorScheme.root}",
                "borderColor" : "{!$brand.colorScheme.neutral}",
                "linkColor" : "#0054A6",
                "textColor" : "{!$brand.colorScheme.contrast}"
              },
              "lightning:margin" : "{!$brand.spacing.none}",
              "lightning:padding" : "{!$brand.spacing.none}",
              "lightning:typography" : {
                "fontFamily" : "{!$brand.baseFontFamily}",
                "fontSize" : "{!$brand.fontSize.medium}",
                "fontWeight" : "{!$brand.fontWeight.normal}",
                "letterSpacing" : "normal",
                "lineHeight" : 1.5,
                "textTransform" : "none"
              },
              "text" : "Elementary school is only the beginning.<br /><br />At Zeta Middle School, students build independence and discover more about who they are while taking on increasingly rigorous academics. Experiential journeys bridge classroom learning with real-life lessons. At Zeta High School, the focus expands to <strong>purpose, passion, and power</strong>, with college preparation and opportunities to experience the world beyond school through Z Journeys. Z Houses and small Z Pods (learning groups) create a strong sense of belonging along the way.<br /><br /><strong>Families who choose Zeta for Elementary School have a school that partners with them all the way through high school.</strong>  Along the way, children will learn within a community that knows them deeply and grows with them.<br /><br />If you would like to learn more about our Pre-K through Grade 12 journey, <a href=\"https://zetaschools.org/events-for-prospective-families/?sftoken&#61;eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpYXQiOjE3ODk1NzU0ODQsImV4cCI6MTc4OTU3NTU0NCwiaW5kaXZpZHVhbElkIjoiaW5kaXZpZHVhbF9pZF9hYnNlbnQiLCJ0ZW5hbnRJZCI6ImEzNjAvcHJvZDIxLzZiMTEwNDZhM2VhZTQyMTM4Yjc1MzkyY2YyYTAzZmFlIiwiY29yZVRlbmFudElkIjoiY29yZS9wcm9kLzAwRGE1MDAwMDFBQTRCQkVBMSJ9.nNn0ejs6PONejnVl7eRo5ttdktXAgyQX6o0NiRuqUkg\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer\"><u>sign up here for an upcoming tour</u></a>.<br /><br />We look forward to welcoming you soon.<br /><br />Warmly,<br /><strong>The Zeta Enrollment Team</strong><br />Zeta Charter Schools<br /><br /><em>Please reach out if you have any questions about Zeta. Our Enrollment Team is here for you every step of the way:<br />✉︎  <a href=\"mailto:enroll&#64;zetaschools.org\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer\">enroll&#64;zetaschools.org</a><br />&#x1f4de;<a href=\"tel:16464801654\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer\">(646) 480-1654</a></em><br />"
            },
            "definition" : "lightning/paragraph",
            "id" : "18ab3856-066c-47f3-be32-7e0c1a2d60d8",
